Your reflexes are lightning-fast, if you spot a projectile (arrow, shot, spell, …) you can instantly shoot at it without taking a turn to take it down.

You can shoot down up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] projectiles.

In addition, your heightened senses also reduce the speed of incoming projectiles by [15%, 26%, 35%, 43%, 50% (TL1-5)], and prevents your own projectiles from striking you.
